],"#Service Model Foundation data model#Related#{9}":[210,211]},"outlinks":[{"title":"data models","target":"data-models","line":20},{"title":"case management","target":"case-management","line":46},{"title":"points","target":"gamification-components-points","line":46},{"title":"highlights","target":"migration-form-highlights","line":46},{"title":"Configuring households","target":"configure-households","line":126},{"title":"Roles","target":"csm-data-model-roles","line":153},{"title":"Responsibility definitions","target":"csm-data-model-responsibilities","line":169},{"title":"create relationships","target":"configure-data-model-relationships","line":173},{"title":"Relationships","target":"csm-data-model-relationships","line":186},{"title":"Configuring households","target":"configure-households","line":202},{"title":"Service Model Foundation roles","target":"csm-data-model-roles","line":203},{"title":"Service Model Foundation responsibilities","target":"csm-data-model-responsibilities","line":204},{"title":"Service Model Foundation relationships","target":"csm-data-model-relationships","line":205},{"title":"Data models","target":"data-models","line":206},{"title":"Highlights","target":"migration-form-highlights","line":207},{"title":"Points","target":"gamification-components-points","line":208},{"title":"Case management","target":"case-management","line":209},{"title":"Create relationships","target":"configure-data-model-relationships","line":210}],"metadata":{"title":"Service Model Foundation data model","description":"The Service Model Foundation data model defines the underlying structure that supports data consistency and relationships across Service Model Foundation. The data model explains its purpose, including how entities such as services, locations, and accounts are organized and connected through the entity-relationship Diagram \\(ERD\\) and reference architecture. It provides a unified view of data design, confirming scalability, integrity, and seamless integration across Service Model Foundation components.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/customer-service-management/data-models-smf.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Overview","Configure Service Model Foundation","Data models","Set up your environment","Configure","Customer Service Management"],"tags":["#customer-service-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/customer-service-management/data-models-smf.md"},
